  "notes": "Issue #516. Single change vs EXP-374: multiply the existing fold-train balanced_sample_weight by a fixed 1.5x extra factor for samples in the lowest burden quartile of that fold's TRAIN partition only (quantile boundary computed on fold-train, never on validation/test or the full unsplit train set). Motivation: EXP-374 OOF error analysis found low-burden samples (few mutated genes) are disproportionately misclassified (mean burden 28.6 wrong vs 44.8 correct; per-class burden/recall correlation +0.38), and balanced_sample_weight only corrects for class frequency, not this burden effect. 1.5x is the pre-declared official candidate; it is not tuned against this run's own OOF result. All EXP-374 features, model hyperparameters, checkpoint policy, folds and seed are unchanged.",
